    _name '_dft_atom_type_nuclear_charge'
    _type numb
    _definition
; PLEASE ADD A HUMAN-READABLE SEMI-FORMAL DESCRIPTION HERE.

  This would be 76 for Os but 26.3 for a VCA calculation for the
  Slater-Pauling-curve maximum (70/30 Fe/Co).
;

